2. Monster ATK increases by 8% and DEF increases by 5% each round.]],
  str_monster_ability_3910451 = "When using ranged attacks, creates an illusion at a fixed location. When ramming into targets, creates an illusion beside the target.",
  str_monster_name_2001501 = "Ghost",
  str_monster_desc_2001501 = "A special Far East monster that's said to be \"neither living nor dead\" and is extremely hostile towards the living.",
  str_monster_ability_2001501 = "Their fighting abilities may not be fearsome, but their numbers are.",
  str_monster_name_21601191 = "Revy",
  str_monster_name_21601191_en = "Revy",
  str_monster_name_21601171 = "Gram",
  str_monster_name_21601171_en = "Gram",
  str_monster_name_21601291 = "Luke",
  str_monster_name_21601291_en = "Luke",
  str_monster_name_21500991 = "Areia",
  str_monster_name_21500991_en = "Areia",
  str_monster_name_21500751 = "Odi",
  str_monster_name_21500751_en = "Odi",
  str_monster_name_21300531 = "Jomu",
  str_monster_name_21300531_en = "Jomu",
  str_monster_name_21400401 = "Joanie Boom",
  str_monster_name_21400401_en = "Joanie Boom",
  str_monster_desc_21601191 = "A new Illuminan recruit. A genius in combat, but she is aloof, impulsive, and a poor communicator. Eager to earn glory in battle and prove herself.",
  str_monster_desc_21601171 = "A veteran who once served on Illumina's defensive lines, he has since retired from active duty and now works in logistics. Tough on the outside, but soft on the inside, he is a dependable ally on the battlefield.",
  str_monster_desc_21601291 = "Deputy Commander of an Umbraton mercenary squad, a man of honor, knows everything in the town. Now he's working hard to expand the mercenary's forces.",
  str_monster_desc_21500991 = "A wandering merc in Umbraton. Born with a curse that made her anemic, and must depend on her magic sword to survive.",
  str_monster_desc_21500751 = "A Rediesel Wrench tech personnel who is highly confident in her comm tech. She likes to complain and yell at others in the Comm Channel, but she gets flustered when there are problems.",
  str_monster_desc_21300531 = "A merchant from Rediesel Wrench. A typical money-grabbing trader, he never passes up an opportunity to turn a profit... Even when faced with some tough tasks, his short knife usually does the trick.",
  str_monster_desc_21400401 = "A little girl fascinated with explosions, who gets unusually excited when something detonates. Such madness is a ticket to Rediesel Wrench. As a Rediesel, she spends all her time studying explosives and couldn't care less if her life is ever in danger...",
  str_monster_ability_21601191 = "Adept at ranged attacks, deals damage to a column area.",
  str_monster_ability_21601171 = "Adept at melee attacks, uses skills to deal large area damage to surrounding enemies.",
  str_monster_ability_21601291 = "Adept at ranged attacks, uses full-screen skill to deal damage and inflict Parasitic Mark on enemies. Each time the enemy moves, they take Parasitic Mark damage.",
  str_monster_ability_21500991 = "Adept at area attacks, her skills increases her own ACT and ATK to deal large area damage.",
  str_monster_ability_21500751 = "Adept at ranged area attacks, attacks inflict Poison.",
  str_monster_ability_21300531 = "Adept at melee attacks, attacks inflict Bleed.",
  str_monster_ability_21400401 = "Does not move, but uses a large area of attack, changes the elements of tiles within range, and inflicts Burn.",
  str_monster_name_1300221 = "Chainsaw Rick",
  str_monster_desc_1300221 = "The noisy and crazy short boy who never seems to stop and always has a bunny headgear on. He's constantly pushing his limits in battle and is often misunderstood as having a death wish. It's a miracle that he's still alive.",
  str_monster_ability_1300221 = "Chainsaw Rick deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a red tile.",
  str_monster_name_1300521 = "Dove",
  str_monster_desc_1300521 = "A mail carrier working for the Illumina Federation, yet she's not a member. She only provides it postal services, and is a total slacker without a shred of professional pride, willing to go to any length to put off or get out of work.",
  str_monster_ability_1300521 = "Dove deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a green tile.",
  str_monster_name_1400321 = "Angel",
  str_monster_desc_1400321 = "A Lumo Hall of Justice staff and a one-winged angel. She is sensitive and has a strong sense of pride. Despite her age, Angel has lived through the war.",
  str_monster_ability_1400321 = "Angel deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a yellow tile.",
  str_monster_name_1501491 = "Roy",
  str_monster_desc_1501491 = "The logistics manager of Rediesel Wrench. Though he does come across as disorganized, he's in fact very thoughtful and protective of everyone in Rediesel Wrench.",
  str_monster_ability_1501491 = "Roy deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a yellow tile.",
  str_monster_name_1400411 = "Ms. Blanc",
  str_monster_desc_1400411 = "A calm and elegant woman, she acts as a guide for newcomers to Lumopolis. She stays composed even in catastrophes, hinting at an extraordinary past, but when asked about it, she merely settles for a mysterious smile...",
  str_monster_ability_1400411 = "Ms. Blanc deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a blue tile and turns all tiles around her blue.",
  str_monster_name_1300471 = "Zoya",
  str_monster_desc_1300471 = "A genius researcher of the Illumina Federation whose hunger for knowledge takes up all her attention... That, and a certain Legion Commander. Although she seems quiet, approaching her in haste will likely invite ridicule. For everyone's sake, it would be better not to disturb her too often.",
  str_monster_ability_1300471 = "Zoya restores HP to the teammate with the lowest HP.",
  str_monster_name_1300531 = "Jomu",
  str_monster_desc_1300531 = "A merchant from Rediesel Wrench. A typical money-grabbing trader, he never passes up an opportunity to turn a profit... Even when faced with some tough tasks, his short knife usually does the trick.",
  str_monster_ability_1300531 = "Jomu deals damage to enemies within 1 surrounding cluster.",
  str_monster_name_1201631 = "Tourdog",
  str_monster_desc_1201631 = "A Mysterious Creature from the north that's passionate about games. Whenever it comes across someone new, it'll always ask, \"esteemed master, do you accept commissions?\"",
  str_monster_ability_1201631 = "Has a burning passion for dancing.",
  str_monster_name_1600061 = "Carleen",
  str_monster_desc_1600061 = "The Lumo Gardens Captain is also Schwartz's daughter. A noble lady who can never tolerate villainy, she respects order and detests evil. What's even more amazing is that she became a knight, not through her father's influence, but by her own efforts.",
  str_monster_ability_1600061 = "Carleen not only deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a blue tile but also inflicts damage on other enemies in the same column and knocks them back.",
  str_monster_name_1600111 = "Sharona",
  str_monster_desc_1600111 = "A Legion Commander of the Illumina Federation and a cold beauty with the power of dragons. Despite her icy appearance, she's someone you can count on. Her origins are shrouded in mystery. After joining the Federation, she became the Legion Commander through her military achievement. She always carries her Azure Flame blade that symbolizes her heritage.",
  str_monster_ability_1600111 = "Sharona deals damage to enemies within 2 surrounding clusters.",
  str_monster_name_1500331 = "Vice",
  str_monster_desc_1500331 = "A member of the Illumina Federation with a gentle personality. Not only is she highly talented, hardworking, and enthusiastic, she has also received intensive training since a young age thanks to the recognition from high officials. She's now appointed as the expedition captain who's responsible for the search and excavation of ancient ruins.",
  str_monster_ability_1500331 = "Vice not only deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a blue tile but also inflicts continuous damage on the closest enemy.",
  str_monster_name_1600021 = "Hiiro",
  str_monster_desc_1600021 = "A girl with unrivaled fighting skills. As a Legion Commander of the Illumina Federation, she's known to be strict, serious, and determined. Facing each battle with calculated confidence, she's scored many victories with her katana in hand.",
  str_monster_ability_1600021 = "Hiiro not only deals damage to the closest enemy unit next to a green tile but also inflicts Crimson Sakura on the closest enemy.",
  str_monster_name_2800601 = "Bullock 8",
  str_monster_desc_2800601 = "Designed especially for the rally, this vehicle has been refitted to traverse harsh terrain. It is not only durable, but also heavily armed.",
  str_monster_ability_2800601 = "Unable to cast skills without a driver.",
  str_monster_name_2000191 = "Toto",
  str_monster_desc_2000191 = "In reality, every little Slasher has a dream. It's just that no one ever cared to ask.",
  str_monster_name_1500901 = "Barbara",
  str_monster_desc_1500901 = "The idol singer of Rediesel Wrench. Barbara looks gentle and nice on the surface but reveals her irritable side when she encounters an overly offensive fan. She travels everywhere to become the most popular idol.",
  str_monster_ability_1500901 = "Barbara deals damage to all enemies occupying Red tiles.",
  str_monster_name_1501141 = "Genevieve",
  str_monster_desc_1501141 = "Elegant bounty hunter of the True Order who is cheerful and likes to enjoy a glass of gin here and there. She is currently trying to build an intelligence network to track down the whereabouts of a certain individual.",
  str_monster_ability_1501141 = "Genevieve leaps at enemies located diagonally from her position, and after landing, deals damage to 1 surrounding cluster. If there is a target at the landing point, she deals severe damage to the target and knocks them back.",
  str_monster_name_1600141 = "Schwartz",
  str_monster_desc_1600141 = "The Governor of Lumopolis and its current ruler, whose position and status put him far above the rest. Such success is not without its costs, and loneliness is his constant companion. Nevertheless, Schwartz spends countless hours maintaining order in Lumopolis, and always strives to do his best while never letting his guard down.",
  str_monster_ability_1600141 = "Schwartz deals damage to all enemies on the battlefield while summoning Lumo Guards to eliminate his enemies.",
  str_monster_name_2001701 = "Wailer",
  str_monster_desc_2001701 = "An Eclipsite that's mainly active at night. During the day, it prostrates on the ground and is unable to move.",
  str_monster_ability_2001701 = "During the day, it prostrates on the ground and stays in a defensive stance. Once night begins, it resumes its true state.",
  str_monster_name_3902501 = "Minos",
  str_monster_name_3902501_en = "Minos",
  str_monster_alias_3902501 = "Desolation Codex",
  str_monster_desc_3902501 = [[
1. Nefarious monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the amount of damage they take. Each enhancement stack increases their ATK by 10%.
2. Each round, monster ATK increases by 8% and DEF increases by 5%.]],
  str_monster_ability_3902501 = "Summons a weakened tile at a random position each round. Deals damage to target once each time it passes over a weakened tile. Chargeable skill deals full-screen damage.",
  str_monster_name_3903101 = "Barbara",
  str_monster_name_3903101_en = "Barbara",
  str_monster_alias_3903101 = "Desolation Codex",
  str_monster_desc_3903101 = [[
1. Nefarious monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the amount of damage they take. Each enhancement stack increases their ATK by 10%.
2. Monster ATK increases by 8% and DEF increases by 5% each round.]],
  str_monster_ability_3903101 = "Always move to the farthest location from the target. Deals large area damage except for some specific safe zones. Chargeable skill deals full-screen damage and knocks back the targets.",
  str_monster_name_3903201 = "Connolly",
  str_monster_name_3903201_en = "Connolly",
  str_monster_name_3903301 = "Beryl",
  str_monster_name_3903301_en = "Beryl",
  str_monster_alias_3903201 = "Desolation Codex",
  str_monster_alias_3903301 = "Desolation Codex",
  str_monster_desc_3903201 = [[
1. Nefarious monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the amount of damage they take. Each enhancement stack increases their ATK by 10%.
2. Monster ATK increases by 8% and DEF increases by 5% each round.]],
  str_monster_desc_3903301 = [[
1. Nefarious monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the amount of damage they take. Each enhancement stack increases their ATK by 10%.
2. Monster ATK increases by 8% and DEF increases by 5% each round.]],
  str_monster_ability_3903201 = "Tentacles are invoked every round at random spots to hinder Aurorians' movement. The tentacles' HP increases round by round. Skills deal area damage and chargeable skills deal full-screen damage.",
  str_monster_ability_3903301 = "Sanguine Crystal is invoked every round at random spots to hinder Aurorians' movement. When Nefarious Beryl passes a crystal, she smashes the crystal and gains an ATK boost from it. Skills deal area damage and chargeable skills deal full-screen damage.",
  str_monster_name_3903401 = "Schwartz",
  str_monster_name_3903401_en = "Schwartz",
  str_monster_ability_2900913 = "Attacks wherever the player was located in the previous round. This monster will resurrect at its location several rounds after dying.",
  str_monster_name_2903001 = "Core Guardian",
  str_monster_name_2903001_en = "Core Guardian",
  str_monster_desc_2903001 = "A gigantic guardian that protects the ship's energy core. It will wake up and fight when the Core is under threat.",
  str_monster_ability_2903001 = "This powerful being has the ability to alter the whole board, but it also has an Achilles heel.",
  str_monster_name_2001801 = "Crusher Wheel",
  str_monster_desc_2001801 = "One of the defense systems of the Energy Core and hard to destroy. It will launch endless attacks on enemies.",
  str_monster_ability_2001801 = "An indestructible being. When its HP is down to zero, it will enter a paralyzed state. It becomes invincible in that state and will automatically recover HP each round. When its HP is full, it will regain the ability to move and take action.",
  str_monster_name_2001802 = "Freeze Module",
  str_monster_desc_2001802 = [[
The cooling module allows the powerful Core Guardian to function normally.
It might be the only weakness of the guardian, but if you approach it rashly, you will get burned by the heat it emits.]],
  str_monster_ability_2001802 = "Disrupts an area and deals damage to Aurorians for every tile moved within the disrupted area.",
  str_monster_desc_2900311 = "An incredibly powerful Eclipsite that is said to have fought countless wars. A strong being that has survived showers of bullets and bombs. No one knows how many of its enemies have fallen under its blades.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900144 = "Out of the Blue: Gloom Ghoul",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900144 = "Summons a Rune at a random location, which turns into a Gloom Ghoul in 3 rounds.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900184 = "Out of the Blue: Shadowgeist",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900184 = "Summons a Rune at a random location, which turns into a Shadowgeist within 3 rounds.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000451 = "Servant's Sacrifice",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000451 = "Restores a certain amount of HP to the player when killed.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900611 = "Deathless: Clone",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900611 = "Divides into smaller combat units when killed.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900641 = "Caracalune: Contamination",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900641 = "Deals a small amount of damage to the player and locks the tiles within 1 surrounding cluster of the player.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900661 = "Shatterblast: Earth Rift",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900661 = "Generates 2 damaged tiles randomly on the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900671 = "Schummer: Annihilation",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900671 = "When all Schummer's Daemons have been activated, Schummer casts a skill that defeats everything on the screen.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2902200 = "Night Counterattack",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2902200 = "Deals damage to targets within 2 surrounding clusters and recovers some HP based on the accumulated Bruise.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2902301 = "Claudia: Platform",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2902301 = "Claudia cannot be damaged by normal attacks when she is standing on a platform or Asher.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2902301 = "Claudia: Teleport",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2902301 = "When the platform under her is broken, or Asher is knocked out, Claudia teleports to another platform within 2 surrounding clusters or falls onto the ground.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_9000101 = "Flight",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_9000101 = "This enemy can move across the abyss.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000311 = "Double Slash",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000311 = "Dreadblades attacks the target twice.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000221 = "Spikepest",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000221 = "Generates Spikepest on tiles that have been walked on.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000511 = "Confusion",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000511 = "Upon hitting a target, increases the cooldown rounds of this Aurorian's active skill.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000521 = "Lumina Imprisonment",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000521 = "Locks the tiles in 1 surrounding cluster after moving. Loses effect when stunned, frightened, paralyzed, or inflicted with other control effects.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000551 = "Grudge",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000551 = "When attacking, inflicts a curse upon Aurorians of the same element. Cursed Aurorians will not be able to attack or use Active Skills.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2000551 = "Grudge Dissipation",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2000551 = "When killed, removes curses placed by Cursed Fay on Aurorians of the same element.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001701 = "Wailer Parade",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001701 = "It is prostrated on the ground in a defensive stance during the day. Once night begins, it resumes its true state and attacks Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2901001 = "Man in Frame",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2901001 = "Hides when on damaged tiles, taking only area damage, and becomes immune to normal attacks and skills where a tile is selected.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2901301 = "Aurora Weakened",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2901301 = "Damage taken during Aurora Time is greatly increased.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001301 = "Aurora Vital",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001301 = "Can only be attacked by Aurorians during Aurora Time.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903001 = "Core Guardian Intact",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903001 = "When the Core Guardian is alert, only takes single-target damage from attacks that don't select tiles and becomes immune to normal and area attacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2903001 = "Core Guardian Paralyzed",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2903001 = "More weak points are exposed after the Core Guardian is paralyzed, and damage immunity is lost.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000901 = "Timed Self-destruct",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000901 = "Self-destructs after the countdown reaches zero, destroying the tile under it.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001801 = "Crusher Wheel Paralyzed",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001801 = "When Crusher Wheel's HP is reduced to zero, it enters a paralyzed state. When its HP is full again, it regains the ability to move and take action.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001802 = "Freeze Module Failure",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001802 = "The Core Guardian's weakness. When the Freeze Module's HP is reduced to zero, the Core Guardian enters a paralyzed state.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900301 = "Bowlinger Shield",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900301 = "The Energy Shield protects Bowlinger from taking damage. (Paralyze it by attacking an unshielded area with the Deathrider to deal damage to Bowlinger effectively)",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2910281 = "Power Supply Shield",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2910281 = "Each Dark Summoner Beacon on the field reduces the damage taken by Dark Summoner.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2010481 = "Lumiwall",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2010481 = "Aurorians can only deal damage to the Lumiwall after the Phorosion is hiding in this Lumiwall. Other Lumiwalls cannot be attacked.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2901201 = "Light of the Deceiver",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2901201 = "Claymore has the ability to connect and move along tiles of the same color.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2901201 = "Tomb of the Undying",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2901201 = "After Call of the Grave dissipates, Claymore gains a counter skill that deals damage to Aurorians based on the ATK of the Aurorian who cast the skill and recovers its own HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900312 = "Double Slash",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900312 = "Augean attacks the target twice.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2900312 = "Burrow",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2900312 = "Increases movement distance by 2 tiles and recovers in the next round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3900451 = "Nefarious Force",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3900451 = [[
When Nefarious monsters take damage, the element counter effect increases by 100%.
Nefarious monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the damage they take. Each enhancement stack increases their ATK by 10%.
Nefarious monster ATK increases by 8%, and DEF increases by 5% each round.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3910281 = "Energy Magnet",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3910281 = "Each Dark Summoner Beacon on the field increases the ATK of Dark Summoner.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3903101 = "Nefarious Shield",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3903101 = "Immune to damage during its action phase.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3903301 = "Nefarious: Crystal Summon",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3903301 = "Generates Sanguine Crystals at random locations on the field every round (there is a maximum number restriction).",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3903201 = "Nefarious: Born from Dread",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3903201 = "Generates Tentacles at random locations on the field every round (there is a maximum number restriction).",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3902501 = "Nefarious: Appointed Weakening",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3902501 = "Generates weakened tiles at random locations on the field every round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2901341 = "Shattered Heart",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2901341 = "Reduces Fearmonger DEF whenever a Fearmonger Minion dies.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29009211 = "Collapsed Armor",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29009211 = "The initial DEF of Hylingerr is very high, which decreases as the Aurorian's Sanity reduces, down to a minimum of 40%.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2912101 = "Ghost Devourer",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2912101 = [[
Restores 1% of max HP when it absorbs a ghost.
Reduces own DEF by 1% when a ghost on the field dies.]],
  str_monster_name_2903901 = "Casta",
  str_monster_name_2903901_en = "Casta",
  str_monster_desc_2903901 = "Seemingly aloof, but actually very responsible. Teamed up with Pollux to form the mercenary duo dubbed \"Raven's Blood\" in order to better defend the kids living in the church.",
  str_monster_ability_2903901 = "Attacks enemies in melee range with a bayonet or attacks them from a distance with bullets. Attacks enemies with different skills according to their location.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29039011 = "Russian Roulette: Counter",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29039011 = "Whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill, Casta moves 2 tiles towards the Aurorian. When there is any Aurorian within 1 surrounding cluster of Casta, she casts the skill to attack the Aurorian.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29039012 = "Whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill, Casta moves 3 tiles towards the Aurorian. When there is any Aurorian within 1 surrounding cluster of Casta, she casts the skill to attack the Aurorian.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29039013 = "Whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill, Casta moves 3 tiles towards the Aurorian and applies 2 layers of count shield to herself. When there is any Aurorian within 1 surrounding cluster of Casta, she casts the skill to attack the Aurorian.",
  str_monster_name_2903701 = "Self-Propelled Cannon",
  str_monster_name_2903701_en = "Self-Propelled Cannon",
  str_monster_desc_2903701 = "Powerful guards capable of patrolling on their own. Both the main and shoulder cannons are incredibly powerful. Just one such guard can cause great damage.",
  str_monster_ability_2903701 = "It can use turrets to deal continuous damage to the enemy and drive away any enemies that come too close to it. The guard will strengthen itself when it perceives a huge threat.",
  str_monster_ability_4000445 = "Launches melee attacks against targets, and converts all tiles along its movement path into tiles of its own element, generating spikepests along the way.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_4000445 = "Murkmite Flame",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_4000445 = "Generates spikepests along its movement path and converts passed tiles into Red ones.",
  str_monster_name_21500781 = "Robyn",
  str_monster_name_21500781_en = "Robyn",
  str_monster_desc_21500781 = "A member of the Spearows in Umbraton. A shy introvert, she sticks close to her sister, Dayna, while trying to survive in Umbraton.",
  str_monster_ability_21500781 = "Dayna becomes more powerful when defeated.",
  str_monster_name_21400481 = "Dayna",
  str_monster_name_21400481_en = "Dayna",
  str_monster_desc_21400481 = "Already the leader of the Spearows despite her young age, she is well known for establishing a firm foothold in the dark and grimy alleys of Umbraton with her unsurpassed determination and diabolical, sneaky weapons.",
  str_monster_ability_21400481 = "Adept at ranged attacks, deals damage to a column area.",
  str_monster_name_21400911 = "Chloe",
  str_monster_name_21400911_en = "Chloe",
  str_monster_desc_21400911 = "A gentle and friendly musician of Lumopolis who is easily drowned in her sad memories. She lost her family due to the war, so she lives in sorrow and finds it hard to let go of it.",
  str_monster_ability_21400911 = "Boosts ally ATK based on the number of Blue tiles on the field.",
  str_monster_ability_21400912 = "Boosts ally ATK based on the number of Blue tiles on the field. Also increases ACT.",
  str_monster_name_21200501 = "Korgon",
  str_monster_name_21200501_en = "Korgon",
  str_monster_desc_21200501 = "It's a terrifying shark even when it smiles! He is the protector of a small settlement, and despite the ferocious, fearsome exterior, he is actually a very gentle cat-lover.",
  str_monster_ability_21200501 = "Deals powerful attacks that can cause knockback upon hitting a target.",
  str_monster_name_21300491 = "Seleucid",
  str_monster_name_21300491_en = "Seleucid",
  str_monster_desc_21300491 = "A tall, strong warrior who often strides throughout Umbraton in full armor with a great sword. A man of few words, he has never taken his helmet off and prefers letting brute force do his talking.",
  str_monster_ability_21300491 = "Resets non-Blue tiles within 1 surrounding cluster while dealing damage.",
  str_monster_ability_4900251 = "Deals cross-shaped area attacks and summons a clone to fight alongside. Upon cloning itself, it absorbs the former clone's HP to recover HP and boost its ATK. When the clone is present, the real form of Phantom can also dodge attacks, but it will also take damage when the clone gets injured.",
  str_monster_ability_4910252 = "On arrival, it becomes rabid and summons a clone to fight alongside. If the Phantom absorbs the clone, it recovers HP and greatly increases ATK.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290370113 = "Mechanism Reaction",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290370113 = "Moves 1 tile and summons 1 T256 in front",
  str_monster_name_4910181 = "Regina",
  str_monster_name_4910181_en = "Regina",
  str_monster_desc_4910181 = "Her bold and uninhibited nature, as well as her impulsiveness, are the marks of a true rock n' roll soul! Her fierce musical style made her exceedingly popular within Rediesel Wrench, allowing her to not only inspire troops, but also lead them in a charge.",
  str_monster_ability_4910181 = "Chases enemies and launch attacks with intimidating action.",
  str_monster_name_4903101 = "Barbara",
  str_monster_name_4903101_en = "Barbara",
  str_monster_desc_4903101 = "The idol singer of Rediesel Wrench. Barbara looks gentle and nice on the surface but reveals her irritable side when she encounters an overly offensive fan. She travels everywhere to become the most popular idol.",
  str_monster_ability_4903101 = "Throws \"bombs\" to the field to hamper enemies.",
  str_monster_ability_49031011 = "Summons items to the field to hamper enemies.",
  str_monster_name_4910301 = "Sinsa",
  str_monster_name_4910301_en = "Sinsa",
  str_monster_desc_4910301 = "The outspoken leader of Rediesel Wrench who is incredibly close with his members and very protective of his little sister. He is dedicated to ensuring the gang's survival.",
  str_monster_ability_4910301 = "A powerful attacker whose strenth transforms after Eve's defeat.",
  str_monster_name_4911051 = "Eve",
  str_monster_name_4911051_en = "Eve",
  str_monster_desc_4911051 = "Sinsa's younger sister who fell under Eclipsite influence and lost control as a child. She has regained her innocence after being healed.",
  str_monster_ability_4911051 = "Capable of precision attacks and wide area damage.",
  str_monster_ability_4900141 = "Excels at melee attacks and has the ability to summon other Eclipsites. After it turns Rabid, its normal attacks deal damage twice with greatly enhanced skill range.",
  str_monster_ability_4900181 = "Excels at ranged attacks that will stun the target and summon Eclipsites. After it turns Rabid, its normal attacks deal damage twice with greatly enhanced skill range.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_21500781 = "Sibling Bond",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_21500781 = "Robyn becomes more powerful when Dayna is defeated.",
  str_monster_ability_4900641 = "Excels at using large area attacks. Locks up the elements of the tiles around it after it moves.",
  str_monster_ability_4900661 = "Shatterblast will crush tiles at the beginning of the battle. This attack can knock back targets.",
  str_monster_name_2903801 = "Astor",
  str_monster_name_2903801_en = "Astor",
  str_monster_desc_2903801 = "A roaming, female spirit with neither a master nor a will of its own; aside from its feminine appearance, all that remains is a terrible enmity towards the living. Through sinister rituals, this spirit can be combined with Darkflow to create a powerful supernatural entity.",
  str_monster_ability_2903801 = "Rampages through a designated area and absorbs the energy of Deathly Candles to strengthen itself.",
  str_monster_ability_39038011 = "Rampages through a designated area, evoking the energy of Deathly Candles to deal damage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903801 = "Candlelight Wish",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903801 = [[
When no Aurorians are within attack range, Astor begins lighting nearby Deathly Candles (if all Deathly Candles are lit, Astor recovers 20% of her max HP).
In addition, each lit Deathly Candle gives Astor 10% damage reduction.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_39038011 = "Candlelight Wish",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_39038011 = [[
When no Aurorians are within attack range, Astor begins lighting Deathly Candles on the battlefield.
If all the Deathly Candles are lit, Astor deals heavy damage to Aurorians.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_39038012 = "Candlelight Wish",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_39038012 = [[
When no Aurorians are within attack range, Astor begins lighting Deathly Candles on the battlefield.
If all the Deathly Candles are lit, Astor deals heavy damage to Aurorians.
If not all the Deathly Candles are lit, Astor deals a small amount of damage to Aurorians.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903802 = "Candlelight Wish",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903802 = [[
When no Aurorians are within attack range, Astor begins lighting nearby Deathly Candles (if all Deathly Candles are lit, Astor recovers 20% of her max HP).
In addition, each lit Deathly Candle increases Astor's damage reduction, and each extinguished Deathly Candle increases Astor's ATK.]],
  str_monster_name_2903600 = "Diavola Flower",
  str_monster_name_2903601 = "Diavola",
  str_monster_name_2903601_en = "Diavola",
  str_monster_desc_2903601 = "Diavola likes to hide and eliminate its enemies stealthily with poison.",
  str_monster_ability_2903601 = "Diavola can't move. It has strong resistance, its body wrapped in poisonous thorns. Its flowers can attract Dawn Sprites, but also exposes its weakness.",
  str_monster_desc_2000609 = "An illusion created by Diavola that contains a magical power.",
  str_monster_ability_2000609 = "Attaches itself to Diavola and increases its ATK when within 1 surrounding cluster of Diavola.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903600 = "Damage Avoidance",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903600 = "Diavola's flowers can only be damaged by Sniper skills and are immune to normal attacks and area damage. When its flowers have zero HP remaining, Diavola is paralyzed and it no longer inflicts Toxin on Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903601 = "Corrosion",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903601 = "When awakened, Diavola counterattacks every normal attack, inflicting 1 stack of Toxin on Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000609 = "Heal",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000609 = "When Dawn Sprite is defeated, it restores a small amount of team HP and reduces the team's number of Toxin stacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000639 = "Restore a modicum of HP to Dawn Sprite after it's defeated by Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_2001901 = "Lantern Spirit",
  str_monster_name_2001901_en = "Lantern Spirit",
  str_monster_desc_2001901 = "An Eclipsite that was modified by Asmodeus. Its desires are controlled by Asmodeus, so it obeys her every command.",
  str_monster_ability_2001901 = "Attacks create chains that cause both damage received and HP recovered between linked parties to be shared.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001901 = "Chains",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001901 = "When either party connected by the chain takes damage or recovers HP, the other party will take the same amount of damage or recover the same amount of HP. When the chain is connected to an Aurorian, it will break after exceeding a certain length.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2001902 = "Teleport",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2001902 = "The Lantern Spirit can Teleport if it can pass through the tile the Aurorian is on and move to the tile on the other side.",
  str_monster_name_2903401 = "Asmodeus",
  str_monster_name_2903401_en = "Asmodeus",
  str_monster_desc_2903401 = "The powerful Wraith has the terrifying ability to see through all the desires of its opponents and enjoys manipulating them.",
  str_monster_ability_2903401 = "When the Asmodeus immune to normal attack damage and the Asmodeus immune to skill damage are both on the field, their HP is shared through the Chain of Desire, and she can also torture her prey with her Chain of Nightmares.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29034001 = "Asmodeus: Chain of Desire",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29034001 = "When either Asmodeus connected by the Chain of Desire takes damage or recovers HP, the other Asmodeus will take the same amount of damage or recover the same amount of HP. After Asmodeus takes action, Dark Regions will be generated under the Chain of Desire.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29034002 = "Asmodeus: Switch Out",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29034002 = "Before Asmodeus takes action, her two bodies may switch positions to make it easier for her to hunt down targets.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903401 = "Asmodeus: Chain of Nightmares",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903401 = "Aurorians connected by the Chain of Nightmares will take damage for every tile they traverse. Leaving the effective range of the Chain of Nightmares will break it.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903411 = "Asmodeus: Soul Severance",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903411 = "When the link between Aurorians and the Chain of Nightmares is severed, Aurorians receive high damage.",
  str_monster_name_2903501 = "Cerritus",
  str_monster_name_2903501_en = "Cerritus",
  str_monster_desc_2903501 = "The new Eclipsite encountered during the exploration seems to be a variant of a powerful Eclipsite, except it is more deranged and far more destructive.",
  str_monster_ability_2903501 = "Cerritus attacks Aurorians by ramming into them and has the powerful ability to summon Pebbles and change the terrain. Cerritus grows stronger as the battle progresses. Attacks that don't kill Cerritus only make it stronger! Every few rounds, Cerritus roars angrily and enters a mad state.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29034011 = "Cerritus: Angry Howl",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29034011 = "Every 2 rounds, Cerritus howls angrily and heals, gaining ATK and movement but losing DEF. At the same time, it summons Pebbles all over the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29034012 = "Cerritus: Angry Howl",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29034012 = "Every 2 rounds, Cerritus howls angrily and heals, gaining ATK and movement but losing DEF. At the same time, it summons Pebbles all over the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2903501 = "Cerritus: Angry Howl",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903501 = "Every 2 rounds, Cerritus howls angrily and heals, gaining ATK and movement but losing DEF. At the same time, it summons Pebbles all over the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2903504 = "Every 2 rounds, Cerritus howls angrily and heals, gaining ATK and movement. At the same time, it summons Pebbles all over the field.",
  str_monster_ability_9200164 = "Uses a spear to attack targets and can enhance other Eclipsites.",
  str_monster_name_21600381 = "Phantom",
  str_monster_name_2902902 = "Jormungand",
  str_monster_name_2902902_en = "Jormungand",
  str_monster_desc_2902902 = "An Eclipsite born in the extreme conditions of the end of days. It has a distorted figure and has long lost the ability to think intelligently. All it has left is the desire to keep moving forward and devouring everything in its way.",
  str_monster_ability_2902902 = "Jormungand's body structure allows it to replicate itself at any time. It devours any obstacles in its path, even its own body.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2902902 = "Jormungand: Insatiable",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2902902 = "Jormungand attacks again whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2902901 = "Jormungand: Replication",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2902901 = "At the beginning of the monsters' round, Jormungand self-replicates, growing in length by 1 new segment.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2900251 = "Dodge",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2900251 = "Moves with extreme agility and has a chance to dodge attacks. (Can't dodge when Paralyzed.)",
  str_monster_name_2002001 = "Venomex",
  str_monster_desc_2002001 = "Said to be a distant relative of a species of Eclipsite able to self-detonate, except this variety can launch venomous slime balls, dealing significant damage to living organisms.",
  str_monster_ability_2002001 = "Sprays poison in a straight line or at an Aurorian's location, inflicting Poison on the enemy and its allies within the venom's range.",
  str_monster_ability_2904201 = "Has the ability to attack Aurorians from range and can launch full-screen attacks. Can summon phantoms that cannot attack but surround Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904201 = "Deception",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904201 = "When invincibility ends, 2 Dreamwalker Phantasms are summoned to surround Aurorians. Phantasms cannot attack and cannot be attacked.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904203 = "When invincibility ends, 2 Dreamwalker Phantasms are summoned to surround Aurorians. Phantasms cannot be attacked.",
  str_monster_name_2904001 = "Bennuguardian",
  str_monster_name_2904001_en = "Bennuguardian",
  str_monster_desc_2904001 = "An ancient guardian residing in Secret Territory depths, awakened due to frequent disturbances from intruders. Even Eclipsites are afraid of its powerful abilities. Wanders around the battlefield aimlessly.",
  str_monster_ability_2904001 = "Possesses great power. Accumulates Fury when attacked. When Fury reaches a certain level, enters an Enraged state, reducing damage taken and casting additional powerful skills. If Bennuguardian is invincible when it takes action, it will consume its regenerative energy to restore itself to full HP.",
  str_monster_name_2904202 = "Dreamwalker Phantasm",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29040011 = "Bennu Rebirth",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29040011 = "If Bennuguardian is invincible when it takes action, it will consume its regenerative energy to restore itself to full HP. Its stacks of Fury are cleared at the same time.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29040012 = "Bennu Rage",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29040012 = "Bennuguardian accumulates Fury when attacked. When Fury reaches 50 stacks, it enters an Enraged state, reducing damage taken and casting an additional powerful attack skill after taking action each round. After casting this skill, Bennuguardian's Enraged state fades.",
  str_monster_name_2002101 = "Cozen",
  str_monster_name_2002101_en = "Cozen",
  str_monster_desc_2002101 = "Possesses a remarkable ability to blend into its surroundings. Sometimes, it even looks like an ordinary trap. However, once it reveals itself, it erupts in a murderous rampage.",
  str_monster_ability_2002101 = "Usually hides in Crud. When the countdown is over, it appears and attacks Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2002101 = "Crud",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2002101 = "When the Crud's countdown ends, Cozen appears and attacks Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_2904301 = "Regal",
  str_monster_name_2904401 = "Requiem",
  str_monster_name_2904501 = "Frostfire",
  str_monster_name_2904601 = "Mythos",
  str_monster_name_2904301_en = "Regal",
  str_monster_name_2904401_en = "Requiem",
  str_monster_name_2904501_en = "Frostfire",
  str_monster_name_2904601_en = "Mythos",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904301 = "Regal Hoarfrost",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904301 = "Has the ability to counterattack. Gains 1 stack of Vis each time Aurorians cast Active Skills. When Vis reaches 10 stacks, gains a stackable ATK increase effect at the beginning of the monsters' round. Lasts until the end of the battle.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904401 = "Requiem Taboo Breaker",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904401 = "Has the ability to counterattack. Gains 1 stack of Vis each time Aurorians cast Active Skills. When Vis reaches 10 stacks, launches a full-screen attack at the beginning of the monsters' round, dealing damage to all targets.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904501 = "Frost Fire: The Crash",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904501 = "Has the ability to counterattack. Gains 1 stack of Vis each time Aurorians cast Active Skills. When Vis reaches 10 stacks, marks an area of the field, and at the beginning of the monsters' round, unleashes severe damage in the marked area.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904601 = "Nursery Rhyme: The Hunt",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904601 = "Has the ability to counterattack. Gains 1 stack of Vis each time Aurorians cast Active Skills. When Vis reaches 10 stacks, marks an area of the field, and at the beginning of the monsters' round, unleashes severe damage in the marked area.",
  str_monster_name_2904101 = "Yoh",
  str_monster_name_2904101_en = "Yoh",
  str_monster_desc_2904101 = "Once the leader of the serpentfish, he was enslaved by Aurorians to serve as a navigation tool. Years of mounting hatred has turned him into a powerful fiendling.",
  str_monster_ability_2904101 = "Possesses powerful magic abilities and can control projectiles to deal damage to enemies.",
  str_monster_name_2002202 = "Word",
  str_monster_desc_2002202 = "Yoh projects Words in his mind into reality to attack his enemies.",
  str_monster_ability_2002202 = "When the illusion is not active, Yoh controls \"Words,\" flinging them like projectiles to directly hit Aurorians. (Aurorians can destroy projectiles during this period to avoid taking damage.)",
  str_monster_desc_49031011 = "A Rediesel Wrench tech personnel who is highly confident in her comm tech. She likes to complain and yell at others in the Comm Channel, but she gets flustered when there are problems.",
  str_monster_ability_4903103 = "Always moves to the farthest location from the target. Skill deals large area damage. Chargeable skill deals full-screen damage and knocks targets back.",
  str_monster_ability_4900232 = "Vani can use Energy to strike from a distance.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_48004341 = "Revive",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_48004341 = "Mara Sol recovers 50% of HP when close to death, and then gains the ability to counterattack, but also takes increased damage. This passive skill can only be triggered once.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_48004342 = "Chasm",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_48004342 = "Takes effect after Mara Sol revives. Whenever an Aurorian casts an Active Skill, Mara Sol summons a Chasm to the field.",
  str_monster_ability_4000124 = "An Eclipsite with low-level summoning abilities. Unable to move on its own and fights by summoning Chasms.",
  str_monster_name_2002301 = "Aphonic Assistant",
  str_monster_desc_2002301 = "Possible a certain type of Eclipsite's \"mentor,\" seeing as how they both heal other Eclipsites. The difference is that this Eclipsite is more likely to stay close to its bulkier allies in order to make the most of its skill's special effect.",
  str_monster_ability_2002301 = "Aphonic Assistant moves towards the direction with the largest number of Eclipsites. Can restore the HP of other Eclipsites. The more tiles occupied by other Eclipsites within Aphonic Assistant's skill range, the stronger the effect of its healing.",
  str_monster_name_2904801 = "Pink Sandworm",
  str_monster_name_2904801_en = "Pink Sandworm",
  str_monster_desc_2904804 = "A rare sandworm native to the Rediesel Desert. It is covered in pink scales due to a unique mutation, making it more powerful and fiercer than other sandworms. Because of its rare and special appearance, certain unscrupulous prevaricators have claimed that its scales are rare treasures that can be made into a magic potion that can make all one's wishes come true, but in fact, they are just ordinary pink scales without any special functionality.",
  str_monster_ability_2904801 = "Drills into the ground to find the location of its target, then bursts out into the open. Excels at spitting black sand to attack targets in front of it.",
  str_monster_name_2904701 = "Mechanical Huntsman",
  str_monster_name_2904701_en = "Mechanical Huntsman",
  str_monster_desc_2904701 = "An ancient guardian created for the sole purpose of protecting the secrets of this land. Its attacks are difficult to escape from, and it also has incredible self-recovery to keep it functioning through the ages. No one will want to face it alone.",
  str_monster_ability_2904701 = "Creates a guarded zone within 2 surrounding clusters of itself every round. Aurorians within the guarded zone will take additional damage whenever they attack or move. If Mechanical Huntsman is invincible when it takes action, it will consume its regenerative energy to restore itself to full HP.",
  str_monster_name_2904901 = "The Four Knights",
  str_monster_name_2904901_en = "The Four Knights",
  str_monster_desc_2904901 = "Although they look like ordinary jury members, the plaster headgears on their heads make them look very suspicious. It turns out to be Eclipsites hiding under them! The confusing thing is that they seem to be following someone's instructions...",
  str_monster_ability_2904901 = "The Four Knights have powerful attacks and superb teleport abilities. Whenever 1 of the Four Knights is attacked or recovers HP, the other knights will take the same amount of damage or recover the same amount of HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904901 = "The Four Knights: Mutual",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904901 = "Whenever 1 of the Four Knights is attacked or recovers HP, the other knights will take the same amount of damage or recover the same amount of HP.",
  str_monster_name_2905501 = "Demon Hati",
  str_monster_name_2905501_en = "Demon Hati",
  str_monster_desc_2905501 = "Memories of the past flooded her heart, creating the fearsome Demon Hound as hatred seized control.",
  str_monster_ability_2905501 = "When Demon Hati is on the verge of death, she can consume regenerative energy to restore herself to full HP. She will also cast a powerful skill and enhance herself. Demon Hati deals more damage as her HP decreases and counters Active Skills.",
  str_monster_ability_2905502 = "Demon Hati consumes a portion of her HP to attack and recovers a portion of her lost HP if any Aurorians are hit. Demon Hati deals more damage as her HP decreases!",
  str_monster_ability_2905503 = "When Demon Hati is on the verge of death, she can consume regenerative energy to restore herself to full HP. She will also cast a powerful skill and enhance herself. Demon Hati deals more damage as her HP decreases!",
  str_monster_ability_2905504 = "When Demon Hati is on the verge of death, she can consume regenerative energy to restore herself to full HP. She will also cast a powerful skill and enhance herself. Demon Hati deals more damage as her HP decreases and counters Active Skills.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905501 = "Demon Hati: Recuperation",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905501 = "When Demon Hati is on low HP, she consumes regenerative energy to restore herself to full HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905502 = "Demon Hati: Nether Flames",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905502 = "Whenever Demon Hati consumes regenerative energy, she becomes Demon Hati: Ominous Flame this round, teleports next to Aurorians and consumes 15% of her current HP to deal massive damage to Aurorians. If she hits a target, recovers 15% of her lost HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905503 = "Demon Hati: Sustenance",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905503 = "Demon Hati recovers some of her lost HP when dealing damage to Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905504 = "Demon Hati: Feral",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905504 = "The lower Demon Hati's HP, the greater the damage dealt by the skill.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905505 = "Demon Hati: Retaliate",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905505 = "Whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill, Demon Hati teleports to Aurorians as close as possible within 1 surrounding cluster, then attacks targets within 1 surrounding cluster.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905506 = "Demon Hati: Retaliate",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905506 = "Whenever an Aurorian uses an Active Skill, Demon Hati teleports to Aurorians as close as possible within 2 surrounding clusters, then attacks targets within 1 surrounding cluster.",
  str_monster_name_2905101 = "Driller",
  str_monster_name_2905101_en = "Driller",
  str_monster_desc_2905101 = "A combat robot developed by Illumina. It has performed extremely well in internal tests but hasn't been tested in actual combat yet.",
  str_monster_ability_2905101 = "Driller has 2 states. It moves around the field in its normal state and digs a certain number of Energy Fields and Support Fields every round. When there are a certain number of Energy Fields on the field, it absorbs and assembles a Driller Platform.",
  str_monster_name_2905102 = "Driller Platform",
  str_monster_name_2905102_en = "Driller Platform",
  str_monster_name_2905001 = "Spider Queen",
  str_monster_name_2905001_en = "Spider Queen",
  str_monster_desc_2905001 = "This special Eclipsite resembles spiders and has learned the behavior of spider groups during its evolutionary path. It hides in the darkness where sunlight cannot reach.",
  str_monster_ability_2905001 = "Possessing strong reproductive abilities, it weaves spider webs into a hunting environment.",
  str_monster_name_2002401 = "Spider Hatchling",
  str_monster_desc_2002401 = "Descendants of the Spider Queen who have weak self-awareness and follow her every command.",
  str_monster_ability_2002401 = "Upon the Spider Queen's orders, Spider Hatchlings gather together and attack their prey as a group.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2002401 = "Web Crawl",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2002401 = "Spider Hatchlings only crawl along the web and will create their own path when there is nowhere to go.",
  str_monster_name_2905201 = "Figerald",
  str_monster_name_2905201_en = "Figerald",
  str_monster_desc_2905201 = "As one of the most powerful Wraiths, he attacks with all his strength when his status is threatened.",
  str_monster_ability_2905201 = "Has the power to destroy the environment and always keeps a certain distance from Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_2002501 = "Illumina Soldiers",
  str_monster_desc_2002501 = "Common combat soldiers in the Illumina Army, known for their skill with rifles and combat knives, as well as their tenacity, work ethic, proactiveness in battle, and fearless fighting spirit.",
  str_monster_ability_2002501 = "Uses more ranged attacks. When the battle is fierce, rushes up to enemies and engages them in melee combat to finish them off as soon as possible.",
  str_monster_ability_2002502 = "A skilled melee combatant with the ability to detect and react to the enemy's movements during intense battles, allowing for effective counterattacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200250103 = "Battle Tenacity",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200250103 = "When HP is lower than 50%, all weapon attacks will become melee attacks with a combat knife. At the same time, all accumulated Bruise will turn into restored HP and increase ATK and DEF.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200250113 = "Sharp Counterattack",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200250113 = "Each time the enemy uses an Active Skill, Illumina Soldiers proceed by 1 tile and attack.",
  str_monster_name_2905301 = "Test State Helios",
  str_monster_name_2905301_en = "Test State Helios",
  str_monster_desc_2905301 = "After living alone for more than a decade in the Dark Zone, this Illumina soldier has forgotten everything except fighting. The frightening thing is that he has become stronger in battle after being modified by someone...",
  str_monster_ability_2905301 = "An entity that has strong combat abilities and accumulates Bruises when taking damage. When his attacks miss his target, a Terror Mark is released on the field. Helios' skills become more powerful with every Terror Mark on the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29053011 = "Relentless",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29053011 = "When taking damage, Helios accumulates Bruises equal to 50% of the damage taken.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29053012 = "Terror Mark",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29053012 = "When Helios' Dread Rush or Leap of Terror misses his targets, a Terror Mark is released on the field: he deals damage to the target directly and generates a mark on the tile the target is on.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2904701 = "Revive: Counter",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2904701 = "If Mechanical Huntsman is invincible when it takes action, it will consume its regenerative energy to restore itself to full HP. In the next round after recovering, Mechanical Huntsman will use an extremely dangerous skill that reduces the HP of Aurorians inside the guarded zone to 1.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905102 = "Driller Platform Disassembly",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905102 = "The Driller and the Driller Platform have independent HP. In Driller Platform Mode, players are able to attack the Driller which is hiding behind the platform. If the Driller Platform becomes invincible, it will automatically disassemble to reveal the Driller.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905101 = "Driller Control",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905101 = "When Driller takes action, if there are 6 Energy Fields on the field, it summons the Driller Platform, which occupies 5 tiles where it is standing.",
  str_monster_name_2905401 = "Joshua: Tainted Soul",
  str_monster_name_2905401_en = "Joshua: Tainted Soul",
  str_monster_desc_2905401 = "The invasion of evil matter brings relentless agony and anguish... Her existence, never meant for this world, was brought forth by it...",
  str_monster_ability_2905401 = "She has immense control over her surroundings and is partially resistant to the normal attacks and skills of Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_2003201 = "Mime Kartima",
  str_monster_name_2003201_en = "Mime Kartima",
  str_monster_desc_2003201 = "\"I will safeguard the honor of Kartimas.\"",
  str_monster_ability_2003201 = "While holding a shield for defense, Mime Kartima will adeptly switch between a flail and a shield to strike the target according to their positioning.",
  str_monster_name_2003202 = "Lumopolis Hammerguard",
  str_monster_name_2003202_en = "Lumopolis Hammerguard",
  str_monster_desc_2003202 = "Revised: The elite guardians of Lumopolis, their impenetrable shields and armor stand as fortresses, while the thunderous hammer strikes echo like mighty avalanches.",
  str_monster_ability_2003202 = "While holding a shield for defense, Mime Kartima will adeptly switch between a flail and a shield to strike the target according to their positioning.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200320105 = "Kartima: Shieldguard",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320105 = "Kartima brandishes his shield, reducing damage from frontal attacks. Loses effect when stunned, frightened, paralyzed, or inflicted with other control effects.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200320106 = "Kartima: Unyielding",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320106 = "Kartima immunes to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 2 rounds after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320107 = "Kartima immunes to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 1 round after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320108 = "Kartima immunes to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 3 rounds after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320109 = "Kartima immunes to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other control effects for 5 rounds after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200320205 = "Shieldguard",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320205 = "Lumopolis Hammerguard brandishes his shield, reducing damage from frontal attacks. Loses effect when stunned, frightened, paralyzed, or inflicted with other control effects.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200320206 = "Unyielding",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320206 = "Immune to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 2 rounds after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320207 = "Immune to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 1 round after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200320208 = "Immune to Stun, Frighten, Paralysis, and other Control effects for 3 rounds after joining the battle",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_39002111 = "Call of Stone",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_39002111 = "Umbrahulk summons Pebbles randomly onto the battlefield at the end of each round",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3900452 = "Forsaken Power",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3900452 = [[
When Forsaken monsters take damage, the element counter effect increases by 100%.
Forsaken monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the damage they take.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_3900453 = "Forsaken Power",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_3900453 = "Forsaken monsters will continuously enhance themselves according to the damage they take.",
  str_monster_name_2904804 = "Forsaken: Pink Sandworm",
  str_monster_name_2904804_en = "Forsaken: Pink Sandworm",
  str_monster_name_4904901 = "Forsaken: The Four Knights",
  str_monster_name_4904901_en = "Forsaken: The Four Knights",
  str_monster_name_39038011 = "Forsaken: Astor",
  str_monster_name_39038011_en = "Forsaken: Astor",
  str_monster_name_3100311 = "Forsaken: Augean",
  str_monster_name_3100311_en = "Forsaken: Augean",
  str_monster_desc_3900311 = "Forsaken: Augean becomes immune to all Aurorian attacks and summons a clone to engage the player. Damage inflicted on the clone is transferred to the main body.",
  str_monster_ability_3100311 = "Revives a clone every round. The clone can attack targets multiple times and inflict Bleeding. Movement Counter: Every time Aurorians use an Active Skill this round, the clone's movement range increases.",
  str_monster_name_3100312 = "Forsaken Clone",
  str_monster_desc_3900312 = [[
1. All damage received will be fully transferred to the main body. Cannot be immune to percentage-based damage.
2. The clone will have the same ATK and DEF as the main body. The clone's Max HP will increase according to the amount of damage dealt to the main body.]],
  str_monster_ability_3100312 = "Clones can attack targets multiple times. Movement Counter: The clone's movement range will increase each time Aurorians use an Active Skill during the current round.",
  str_monster_name_531400511 = "Mia: Lustrous Soul",
  str_monster_name_531400511_en = "Mia: Lustrous Soul",
  str_monster_desc_531400511 = "A Lumopolis knight who lives a secluded life in Umbraton.",
  str_monster_ability_531400511 = "Gains an additional ATK buff when HP is low. Grants self a shield every 3 rounds to resist damage.",
  str_monster_name_4902501 = "Forsaken: Minos",
  str_monster_name_4902501_en = "Forsaken: Minos",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_4902501 = "Forsaken: Appointed Weakening",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_4902501 = "Generates 4 weakened tiles on a diagonal tile every round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_4902502 = "Forsaken: Phantom Attack",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_4902502 = "If Forsaken: Minos passes an enhanced tile or weakened tile, a phantom will be summoned to deal damage to Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_4900511 = "Forsaken: Nozard",
  str_monster_name_4900511_en = "Forsaken: Nozard",
  str_monster_ability_4900511 = "Outraged, Nozard constantly slaps the ground to knock back the player and summons Gloom Ghouls to aid it in battle. Nozard doesn't take damage from Normal Attacks.",
  str_monster_name_2905404 = "Joshua: Dark Angel",
  str_monster_name_2905404_en = "Joshua: Dark Angel",
  str_monster_name_2905405 = "Joshua: White Demon",
  str_monster_name_2905405_en = "Joshua: White Demon",
  str_monster_name_2000255 = "Cursed Lumo Guard",
  str_monster_name_2000285 = "Cursed Lumo Shieldmate",
  str_monster_name_2000295 = "Cursed Lumo Piker",
  str_monster_desc_2905404 = "As an embodiment of endless grudges, it's a torn part of Joshua's emotions, a formidable entity born in the void, harboring enmity towards all souls radiating love.",
  str_monster_desc_2905405 = "A flawless being summoned from the depths of a mother's call. It has shed useless emotions to achieve the ultimate ideal, the perfect assassin unaffected by feelings.",
  str_monster_desc_2000255 = "Once a loyal guard of Lumopolis, it's now been corrupted and driven into madness by Joshua.",
  str_monster_desc_2000285 = "Even the strongest guardian cannot withstand the corruption of evil. May the walls of Lumopolis be pure once again.",
  str_monster_desc_2000295 = "Back in the day, they said spear-wielders had the worst luck, which turned out to be true, as evil's invasion had them as its targets from the get-go.",
  str_monster_desc_2000606 = "Born from negative emotions, this Eclipsite would track down those burdened with curses.",
  str_monster_ability_2905404 = "Unleashes the endless power of curses, and when the strength of the curse overpowers the life granted by the light, darkness will engulf everything.",
  str_monster_ability_2905405 = "Unleashes the endless power of curses, and when the strength of the curse overpowers the life granted by the light, darkness will engulf everything.",
  str_monster_ability_2000255 = "Guards, rendered unconscious by a curse, shall rise again when entwined by the Lurker or in the presence of Joshua, releasing the power of the curse through their attacks.",
  str_monster_ability_2000285 = "Shieldmates, rendered unconscious by a curse, shall rise again when entwined by the Lurker or in the presence of Joshua, releasing the power of the curse through their attacks.",
  str_monster_ability_2000295 = "Pikers, rendered unconscious by a curse, shall rise again when entwined by the Lurker or in the presence of Joshua, releasing the power of the curse through their attacks.",
  str_monster_ability_2000606 = "Seeks out the cursed soldiers of Lumopolis, possessing them and causing the comatose soldiers to awaken and fall into madness.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2000255 = "Cursed",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2000255 = "When you attack a cursed Aurorian, the Curse point goes up. But upon death, Aurorian emits a final burst of light, reducing the Curse point.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_4904201 = "When invincibility ends, 1 Phantasm is summoned to surround Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_4904202 = "Illusion Revival",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_4904202 = "Illusions only take damage from skills and can transfer a portion of the damage to the Dreamwalker. Upon death, they leave 1 broken tile at their footings before reviving the following round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_49042021 = "Illusions take only damage from single-target strikes and can transfer a portion of the damage to the Dreamwalker. Upon death, they leave 1 broken tile at their footings before reviving in the following round.",
  str_monster_name_5900404 = "Schummer Clone",
  str_monster_ability_4902501 = "Summons weakened tiles around it every round, and absorbs enhanced tiles and weakened tiles on the field when attacking. The more tiles Minos absorbs, the more dangerous Minos' attack is.",
  str_monster_desc_29009112 = "A vile enemy has returned yet again, and it is determined to wipe out all its enemies this time.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29001821 = "Out of the Blue: Shadowgeist",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29001821 = "Summons 2 Shadowgeists at a random location.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29001421 = "Out of the Blue: Gloom Ghoul",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29001421 = "Summons 2 Gloom Ghouls at a random location.",
  str_monster_ability_29001811 = "Skilled in ranged attacks that will stun the target and summon the Shadowgeist. When Rabid, its normal attacks hit twice with greatly enhanced skill range, and it can summon 2 Shadowgeists at the same time.",
  str_monster_ability_29001411 = "Skilled in melee attacks, her attacks will stun the target with the ability to summon the Gloom Ghoul. After she turns Rabid, her normal attacks become double attacks with greatly enhanced skill range, and she can summon 2 Gloom Ghouls at the same time.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_5900404 = "Schummer: Twin",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_5900404 = "Damage taken by Schummer's clone will be transferred to Schummer. When becoming invincible, it is stunned for 1 round, then it recovers all its HP.",
  str_monster_name_2905601 = "Denuo Goddess",
  str_monster_name_2905601_en = "Denuo Goddess",
  str_monster_desc_2905601 = "An extremely rare butterfly, rumored to only appear near Denuo Valley. It's reclusive by nature, with highly acute senses. The combat power of adult Denuo Goddesses should not be underestimated.",
  str_monster_ability_2905601 = "They catalyze plant growth through pollination, protecting themselves while dealing massive damage to foes.",
  str_monster_name_2002601 = "Sadesian Enchantweed",
  str_monster_desc_2002601 = "Initially a moss-like lifeform, but after Denuo Goddess uses Lumina to spur its growth, it'll transform into a plant resembling flowers and herbs.",
  str_monster_ability_2002601 = "Under the catalytic influence of the Denuo Goddess, it gradually evolves into an extremely deadly plant.",
  str_monster_name_2002602 = "Sadesian Enchantweed",
  str_monster_desc_2002602 = "Initially a moss-like lifeform, but after Denuo Goddess uses Lumina to spur its growth, it'll transform into a plant resembling flowers and herbs.",
  str_monster_ability_2002602 = "Under the catalytic influence of the Denuo Goddess, it gradually evolves into an extremely deadly plant.",
  str_monster_name_2002603 = "Sadesian Enchantweed",
  str_monster_desc_2002603 = "Initially a moss-like lifeform, but after Denuo Goddess uses Lumina to spur its growth, it'll transform into a plant resembling flowers and herbs.",
  str_monster_ability_2002603 = "Under the catalytic influence of the Denuo Goddess, it gradually evolves into an extremely deadly plant.",
  str_monster_name_8900181 = "Oblivion Inspirer ",
  str_monster_name_8900181_en = "Oblivion Inspirer",
  str_monster_desc_8900181 = "Could she be someone's younger sister as well? Despite her outward impulsiveness and fierceness, it's evident that deep within lies a vulnerable soul.",
  str_monster_name_8900411 = "Oblivion Knight",
  str_monster_name_8900411_en = "Oblivion Knight",
  str_monster_desc_8900411 = "He is shrouded in an air of betrayal... coupled with a constant struggle against the unjust fate and an insatiable thirst for passion.",
  str_monster_name_8000451 = "Oblivion Minion",
  str_monster_name_8000451_en = "Oblivion Minion",
  str_monster_name_80011471 = "Oblivion Pursuer",
  str_monster_name_80011471_en = "Oblivion Pursuer",
  str_monster_desc_80011471 = "She dwells between remembrance and oblivion, suggesting that she still holds onto something in this world.",
  str_monster_ability_533500302 = "Unable to move on its own, fights by summoning self-destructive Burstbugs.",
  str_monster_name_99005021 = "Forsaken: Solmorph",
  str_monster_name_99005021_en = "Forsaken: Solmorph",
  str_monster_name_99039011 = "Forsaken: Casta",
  str_monster_name_99039011_en = "Forsaken: Casta",
  str_monster_ability_99005021 = "Inflicts unavoidable large-area damage; possesses the ability to change the board's tile color.",
  str_monster_ability_99039011 = "Attacks enemies in melee range with a bayonet or attacks them from a distance with bullets.",
  str_monster_desc_9900501 = "Evolved from the Siphorb, it absorbed so much Lumina that it's unable to control the color of surrounding light.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29060011 = "Grief: Metamorphose",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29060011 = "Every round, summon a Dawn Flower at a set location to restore HP; each Dawn Flower grants an extra recovery boost.",
  str_monster_name_2906001 = "Grieving Eve",
  str_monster_name_2906001_en = "Grieving Eve",
  str_monster_desc_2906001 = "The pain of isolation and the fear of being severed, those unbearable memories of the past, have shaped the person known as Eve today.",
  str_monster_ability_2906001 = "Each round, summon a Dawn Flower at a set location on the battlefield, restoring HP according to the number of Dawn Flowers. In specific rounds, gain multiple stacks of immunity, and then restore HP in the subsequent round based on the immunity stacks.",
  str_monster_name_2006001 = "Dawn Flower",
  str_monster_desc_2006001 = "These simple white flowers, small and ordinary, are among the most precious comforts in her heart.",
  str_monster_ability_2006001 = "Grants additional HP recovery bonus for Grieving Eve.",
  str_monster_ability_2000401 = "Unable to move or attack. Links with the Dark Summoner and offer damage reduction.",
  str_monster_name_2003001 = "Illumina Flamethrower",
  str_monster_desc_2003001 = "\"Reduce all adversaries to ashes\"—They epitomize the efficiency and ruthlessness of the Illumina forces. Before the raging flames, all life stands on an even footing.",
  str_monster_ability_2003001 = "Accumulates Bruises while receiving damage. Deals damage to all targets within the range of attack, inflicting Burn on them and creating fires.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003001 = "Battlefield Mainstay",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003001 = "When taking damage, Illumina Flamethrower accumulates Bruises equal to 50% of the damage taken.",
  str_monster_name_2002901 = "Illumina L5 Tank",
  str_monster_desc_2002901 = "Crafted through truck modifications, the Illumina L5 Tank features lightweight armor, rendering it perfect for mass manufacturing. Its charging prowess and rapid-firing cannons make short work of enemy light units.",
  str_monster_ability_2002901 = "Based on enemy positions, opts for either firing a rapid barrage of shots or a charging rush for attack.",
  str_monster_name_2003401 = "Corrupted Illumina Soldier",
  str_monster_name_2003401_en = "Corrupted Illumina Soldier",
  str_monster_desc_2003401 = "Once allies, now enemies—such is the dread of the Eclipse. The only mercy left is to lay them to rest.",
  str_monster_ability_2003401 = "Creates quagmires on the tiles moved over. When at low HP, increases ACT significantly and boosts DEF.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_20034011 = "Corrupted Mind",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_20034011 = "If HP is below 40% at the start of a round, the unit has its ACT and DEF increased and its attack style altered.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_20034012 = "Corrupted Stride",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_20034012 = "Creates quagmires on the tiles moved over.",
  str_monster_name_2003101 = "Illumina Sergeant",
  str_monster_desc_2003101 = "As the grassroots officers of the Illumina army, they are responsible for commanding regular soldiers on the battlefield. Most of them graduate from military academies, while a select few are promoted from the ranks of experienced veterans.",
  str_monster_ability_2003101 = "Their presence enhances the abilities of nearby Illumina Soldiers and helps them recover from their Bruises. Should they find themselves isolated from allies or in close quarters with foes, these sergeants take up arms, dealing damage with devastating cuts and impactful kicks.",
  str_monster_name_2002701 = "Illumina Medic",
  str_monster_desc_2002701 = "Wherever the Illumina Medic stands, morale elevates, for comrades know that their injuries won't be left untreated. The Illumina Federation, well aware of this fact, provides these medics with enhanced protection, significantly augmenting their survival capabilities.",
  str_monster_ability_2002701 = "An Illumina Soldier without combat capabilities. Restores HP for a nearby Illumina Soldier and restores certain Bruises for their own.",
  str_monster_name_2002801 = "Illumina Signalman",
  str_monster_desc_2002801 = "Equipped with a compact communicator, the Illumina Signalman bears a heavy load. Thus, the Illumina Federation has engineered a specialized support apparatus, facilitating their signal transmission on the move, which is the origin of this unit's name.",
  str_monster_ability_2002801 = "An Illumina Soldier without combat capabilities but able to summon Illumina reinforcements into the battlefield.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2002701 = "Battlefield Tenacity",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2002701 = "When taking damage, Illumina Medic will accumulate Bruises equal to 50% of the damage received. Additionally, their DEF increases as their HP declines.",
  str_monster_name_2003301 = "Dreadweaver",
  str_monster_desc_2003301 = "Driven by an obsession to annihilate all, it disregards the depletion of its own energy, relentlessly pursuing the goal, even if it means gradually marching toward its own demise.",
  str_monster_ability_2003301 = "Once the team's movement ends, Dreadweaver will immediately have the team change their positions, affecting the range of Chain Combos. When Dreadweaver's HP drops below 50%, it will initiate a sacrificial ritual—In the next round, it will burn down its current HP to just 1 point, dealing true damage to players equal to multiple times the burned HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003301 = "Psionic Manipulation",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003301 = "Once the team's movement ends, Dreadweaver will immediately have the team change their positions, affecting the casting of Chain Combos.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003302 = "Blood Sacrifice",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003302 = "When Dreadweaver's HP drops below 50%, it will initiate a sacrificial ritual. In the next round, it will burn down almost all of its HP, dealing massive true damage to players. This effect can only be triggered once.",
  str_monster_name_7001098 = "Forsaken: Schummer the Aviduz",
  str_monster_name_7001098_en = "Forsaken: Schummer the Aviduz",
  str_monster_ability_7001098 = "Periodically summons lightning. The Lightning Power will paralyze the targets hit. Colossus Shriek can draw Aurorians towards the caster.",
  str_monster_name_2906101 = "Corrupted Engine VII",
  str_monster_name_2906101_en = "Corrupted Engine VII",
  str_monster_desc_2906101 = "Originally a colossal combat mecha crafted by Illumina, it turned into one of the most formidable threats after its pilot lost their mind due to contamination by the mud.",
  str_monster_ability_2906101 = "Charges recklessly towards the Illumina Stronghold, dealing damage to Aurorians along the way.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29061011 = "Repair",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29061011 = "Corrupted Engine VII with invincibility will be paralyzed. It will repair its components during this period, and once the repair is complete, it will redeploy for the siege.",
  str_monster_name_2905701 = "Mudbundle",
  str_monster_name_2905701_en = "Mudbundle",
  str_monster_desc_2905701 = "Rumored to be a creation of an Eclipse member, this Eclipsite is a fusion of various biological traits. It creates terrifying quagmires that can devour everything and contaminate it touches.",
  str_monster_ability_2905701 = "Creates quagmires and submerges within, obstructing and disrupting Aurorians' movements within, altering the terrain.",
  str_monster_name_8002005 = "Irridon",
  str_monster_name_8002005_en = "Irridon",
  str_monster_desc_8002005 = "The Lumo Hall of Justice Chief Judge. She is both kind and gentle and upright and tough and has the spirit of self-dedication. A paranoid side of her exists in her heart, but she suppresses it.",
  str_monster_ability_8002005 = "Situated off-field, cannot be targeted by normal attacks. Shares damage with all enemies on the field.",
  str_monster_name_2003501 = "Rimebeast",
  str_monster_name_2003501_en = "Rimebeast",
  str_monster_desc_2003501 = "With its fur and sharp claws, this Eclipsite bears an uncanny resemblance to a savage beast, making it well-suited for infiltrating various border regions for tracking, scouting, and hunting.",
  str_monster_ability_2003501 = "It would select different skills based on the Aurorian's position, and if its attack cannot reach any Aurorians, it will choose to recover its own HP.",
  str_monster_name_2900891 = "Irridon: Eximius",
  str_monster_name_2900891_en = "Irridon: Eximius",
  str_monster_desc_2900891 = "Inheriting her father's earnest teachings and fulfilling all his expectations, she has become the perfect Irridon, the greatest Chief Judge ever known!",
  str_monster_ability_2900891 = [[
Before each Chain Combo of Aurorians, it forms a Shield of Light to block damage.
Increases all damage dealt based on the number of Prejudice stacks on the Aurorians.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29089011 = "Shield of Light",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29089011 = "Before each Chain Combo, forms Shield of Light, blocking damage equal to a percentage of Max HP.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29089012 = "Wrath of Chief Judge",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29089012 = "Possesses multiple segments of HP. At the start of each round, if she has lost a segment of HP compared to the previous round, she will unleash the Punishment of Chief Judge, dealing massive damage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_29089021 = "Damage Transmission",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_29089021 = "Damage dealt to Irridon: Eximius Clones is instantly transferred to Irridon: Eximius.",
  str_monster_name_2003601 = "Crimson Specter",
  str_monster_desc_2003601 = "Arrogance, prejudice, and corrupted thoughts... have congealed into malevolent specters wandering in Lumopolis, seeping into every crevice of this eternal city.",
  str_monster_ability_2003601 = "It can teleport to the nearest player's location, delivering multiple damaging blows and knocking the player back. The farther it teleports, the fewer attacks it launches.",
  str_monster_name_2902131 = "No. 33: The Nameless Keeper",
  str_monster_name_2902131_en = "No. 33 - The Nameless Keeper",
  str_monster_desc_2902131 = "An ancient Aurorian, the guardian of the underground ruins in the Northlands. She has lived alone for years, even her memories start fading.",
  str_monster_ability_2902131 = "Capable of ranged attacks on Aurorians from anywhere; Can alter the Elements of tiles around other Aurorians and itself.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290213101 = "Area Control",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290213101 = "After its action ends in each round, it converts the Elements of tiles in the 2 surrounding clusters.",
  str_monster_ability_5353002 = "Proficient in ranged and AoE attacks; enters a Rabid state when HP falls below 30%, continuously unleashing full-screen damage skills. Counters 1 Active Skill per round and casts 5 stacks of count shield for self-protection.",
  str_monster_ability_5353007 = "Deals damage within a specific area and knocks enemy units back.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name1_2900401 = "Rabid",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc1_2900401 = "Falls into a Rabid state when HP is low: unleash Colossus: Sonic Blast for full-screen attacks every round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name2_2900401 = "Devouring Shield",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc2_2900401 = "Surrounds itself with 5 stacks of count shield, each offering immunity to damage 1 time (Counter is limited to only 1 time per round).",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_5353004 = "Gloom Ghoul Summon",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_5353004 = "Summons a Gloom Ghoul at a random location.",
  str_monster_name_2902801 = "Sanki",
  str_monster_name_2902801_en = "Sanki",
  str_monster_desc_2902801 = "\"When evil beckons in cherry blossoms, the Sakae flees, forsaken by the populace; only one in ten survives.\" With targets in sight, his battle for vengeance begins here.",
  str_monster_ability_2902801 = "Sanki boasts high mobility, launching a quick charge every few rounds to close in on his target and deal damage swiftly. With every move, Sanki releases Sakae Blades onto the field, only to retrieve them all on the next move, dealing massive damage to enemy targets along its paths.",
  str_monster_name_70011021 = "Forsaken: Sanki",
  str_monster_name_70011021_en = "Forsaken: Sanki",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2902801 = "Sakae: Control",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2902801 = "Before Sanki takes action, he releases Sakae Blades in four directions across the field, only to retrieve them all on the next move. Sakae Blades deal massive damage to enemy units along their paths when released or retrieved.",
  str_monster_name_70011023 = "Forsaken: Brock",
  str_monster_name_70011023_en = "Forsaken: Brock",
  str_monster_desc_70011023 = "A member of the Rediesel Wrench Loose Screws team, Brock is a hot-blooded and self-assured goofball who occasionally does foolish things to satisfy his competitive nature.",
  str_monster_ability_70011023 = "With remarkable ATK and ACT, Brock can also pull over enemies to his vicinity via his ultimate skill.",
  str_monster_name_70011041 = "Forsaken: Schwartz",
  str_monster_name_70011041_en = "Forsaken: Schwartz",
  str_monster_desc_70011041 = "The governor of Lumopolis, the greatest ruler, is known for his selfless dedication. He may even grace the arena himself to evaluate everyone's prowess.",
  str_monster_ability_70011041 = "Schwartz harnesses incredible Lightning Power, bestowing upon him a fearsome level of mobility and destructive force. Those who pass his formidable test of strength are regarded as the cream of the crop.",
  str_monster_name_5352021 = "Lumo Shieldmate",
  str_monster_name_5352021_en = "Lumo Shieldmate",
  str_monster_desc_5352021 = "Guards armed with a superior defense shield. With the ability to endure tough battles, they are the strong walls protecting their comrades.",
  str_monster_ability_5352021 = "A stalwart guard with extraordinary defensive capabilities can summon other Lumopolis soldiers to assist in battle and boost their morale. Wields a powerful shield that can be used to inflict devastating melee attacks.",
  str_monster_name_2905801 = "Emperor of Demise",
  str_monster_name_2905801_en = "Emperor of Demise",
  str_monster_desc_2905801 = "The Supreme Emperor of Chaos, Tohru's father, a veteran of many wars, is an undeniable powerhouse no matter when and where.",
  str_monster_ability_2905801 = "With formidable strength, he wields a multitude of skills to target players with precision or unleash wide-ranging attacks, while knocking them back.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2905801 = "Lumina Weakening",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2905801 = "The player's normal and chain combo attacks inflict reduced damage to 5 tiles the boss occupies, excluding the central tile.",
  str_monster_ability_140045106 = "Use Nails",
  str_monster_ability_150092106 = "Deals damage to enemies in an X-shape area while converting Red tiles adverse to the caster.",
  str_monster_ability_160103106 = "Deals damage to the nearest enemy while converting Blue tiles adverse to the caster.",
  str_monster_ability_160111106 = "Fights using crystals, dealing damage to all enemies on the battlefield.",
  str_monster_ability_150009106 = "Deals damage to enemies within a radial-shaped area and can inflict Frighten on targets hit.",
  str_monster_ability_160120106 = "Her gigantic suit of armor, named Pompey, can deal damage across a large area while dealing additional damage to enemies within 1 surrounding cluster.",
  str_monster_ability_160089106 = "Continuously unleashes Gold Marsh Sword Rain to deal damage to adjacent targets.",
  str_monster_name_39004031 = "Forsaken: Schummer",
  str_monster_name_39004031_en = "Forsaken: Schummer",
  str_monster_desc_39004031 = "Originally a Caelestite, but joined Eclipse and possesses tremendous increased power.",
  str_monster_ability_39004031 = "Adept at ranged and area attacks.",
  str_monster_name_39058011 = "Forsaken: Emperor of Demise",
  str_monster_name_39058011_en = "Forsaken: Emperor of Demise",
  str_monster_desc_39058011 = "The Supreme Emperor of Chaos, Tohru's father, a veteran of many wars, is an undeniable powerhouse no matter when and where.",
  str_monster_ability_39058011 = "With formidable strength, he wields a multitude of skills to target players with precision or unleash wide-ranging attacks, while knocking them back.",
  str_monster_ability_5362001 = "Will hide in the Lumiwall farthest from the player; attacks can change the element of the tile on its attack path.",
  str_monster_name_5362001 = "Gronru",
  str_monster_name_5362001_en = "Gronru",
  str_monster_desc_5362001 = "A female pilot of the giant mecha and the current Tech Officer of the Illumina Federation. She's said to be a genius retired from the military... Although she isn't particularly interested in fighting, she's intensely passionate about studying and controlling giant machines, almost to the point of obsession.",
  str_monster_ability_5362002 = "Adept at melee attacks, deals damage to a column area.",
  str_monster_desc_5362002 = "A Rediesel Wrench tech personnel who is highly confident in her comm tech. She likes to complain and yell at others in the Comm Channel, but she gets flustered when there are problems.",
  str_monster_ability_5362003 = "Adept at ranged area attacks, skills inflict Poison.",
  str_monster_name_2909001 = "Merman King",
  str_monster_name_2909001_en = "Merman King",
  str_monster_desc_2909001 = "From the surface world to the underwater town, a domineering and villainous noble.",
  str_monster_ability_2909001 = "Attacks inflict knockback. Can summon salvo guns at the edge of the battlefield.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290900101 = "Salvo Gun Deployment",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290900101 = "At the beginning of each player round, if less than 2 Salvo Guns are on the battlefield, summons 4 Salvo Guns at the edge of the battlefield.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290901101 = "Salvo Gun Deployment",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290901101 = "At the beginning of each player round, if less than 3 Salvo Guns are on the battlefield, summons 4 Salvo Guns at the edge of the battlefield.",
  str_monster_name_70011101 = "Forsaken: Diavola",
  str_monster_name_70011101_en = "Forsaken: Diavola",
  str_monster_desc_70011101 = "Diavola likes to hide and eliminate its enemies stealthily with poison.",
  str_monster_ability_70011101 = "Diavola cannot move. Its body is wrapped in huge, firm thorny leaves that reduces the damage it takes.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_70011101 = "Thorned Leaves",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_70011101 = "Reduces damage taken on the Diavola's outer 8 tiles by 30%.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_70011102 = "Thorned Leaves",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_70011102 = "Reduces damage taken on the Diavola's outer 8 tiles by 50%.",
  str_monster_name_2003801 = "Gang Captain",
  str_monster_desc_2003801 = "The peculiar-looking leader of a gang, skilled in firearms. His presence spells nothing but trouble for Umbraton.",
  str_monster_ability_2003801 = "Attacks after moving away from the target, dealing damage 2 times. Can steal the target's attributes.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003801 = "Deadly Shot",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003801 = "Steals Aurorians' Basic ATK and Basic DEF when dealing damage. The stolen ATK and DEF will be returned after 2 rounds or after this unit is defeated.",
  str_monster_name_2003701 = "Gang Crossbowman",
  str_monster_desc_2003701 = "Accurate, safe, discreet, and incredibly powerful, crossbows have become a beloved weapon among gangsters due to these unparalleled properties. Enemies adept in its use are often highly dangerous.",
  str_monster_ability_2003701 = "Can attack targets in a cross shape to the maximum extent of its range. After hitting, reduces the target's healing received.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003701 = "Shadowed Arrow",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003701 = "After hitting an Aurorian, reduces their healing received by 40%. This effect does not stack and is removed when the Gang Crossbowman is defeated.",
  str_monster_name_2009001 = "Salvo Gun",
  str_monster_desc_2009001 = "An Eclipsite that resembles a gun barrel. Provides support to its companions and attacks your team heavily!",
  str_monster_ability_2009001 = "Fires upon enemies within attack range. If no targets are available, its attack is enhanced and it heals the Merman King.",
  str_monster_name_8003481 = "Dayna",
  str_monster_desc_8003481 = "Despite her young age, she is already the leader of the Spearows. She is well known for establishing a firm foothold in the streets of Umbraton with her unsurpassed determination and diabolical, sneaky weapons.",
  str_monster_ability_8003481 = "Attacks the nearest enemy.",
  str_monster_name_8003781 = "Robyn",
  str_monster_desc_8003781 = "A member of the Spearows of Umbraton. A shy introvert, she sticks close to her sister, Dayna, while trying to survive in Umbraton.",
  str_monster_ability_8003781 = "Follows the player and deals area damage to nearby enemies.",
  str_monster_ability_2300601 = "Lurkers can attach themselves to Aurorians within 1 surrounding cluster of themselves. Once attached, they deal damage to the Aurorian and reduce their ATK.",
  str_monster_name_2909101 = "Rebecca Venomswamp",
  str_monster_desc_2909101 = "Her veins pulsate with crimson venom, ready to eradicate any threat to her family, including herself.",
  str_monster_ability_2909101 = "Enables attacks to inflict the Fusion effect, causing affected targets to lose HP at the beginning of their rounds. Summons Poison Marks on the surrounding tiles each round, imposing Fusion to nearby enemies passing by; Poison Marks transform into Dark Tiles at the end of the round.",
  str_monster_name_2003901 = "Gang Support Specialist",
  str_monster_desc_2003901 = "A hulking gang member of immense strength, skilled in using his mechanical arms for combat. Moreover, he can offer support to other enemy forces of Umbraton in the field.",
  str_monster_ability_2003901 = "Provides boosts of ATK and DEF to Umbraton members within 1 surrounding cluster; heals self when his HP falls below a certain percentage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2003901 = "Extra Support",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2003901 = "Provides boosts of ATK and DEF to Umbraton members within 1 surrounding cluster.",
  str_monster_name_2004101 = "Gang Assassin",
  str_monster_desc_2004101 = "\"The best stab is one that comes from behind.\" Skilled at attacking vital points, this unit's blades are deadly both in street fights and on the battlefield.",
  str_monster_ability_2004101 = "Launches 2 rapid consecutive strikes against the enemy. Steals Aurorians' Basic ATK and DEF when dealing damage. The stolen ATK and DEF will be returned after 2 rounds or after this unit is defeated. Retreats after attacking to protect itself. If the target can't be attacked, ACT +1 in this round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2909101 = "Toxic Corrosion",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2909101 = "Enables attacks to inflict the Fusion effect, causing affected targets to lose HP at the beginning of their rounds. Summons Poison Marks on the surrounding tiles each round, imposing Fusion to nearby enemies passing by; Poison Marks transform into Dark Tiles at the end of the round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2004101 = "Battle Fervor",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2004101 = "Steals Aurorians' Basic ATK and Basic DEF when dealing damage. The stolen ATK and DEF will be returned after 2 rounds or after this unit is defeated.",
  str_monster_name_2909101_en = "Rebecca Venomswamp",
  str_monster_name_2003801_en = "Gang Captain",
  str_monster_name_70011071 = "Forsaken: Kittypus",
  str_monster_name_70011071_en = "Forsaken: Kittypus",
  str_monster_desc_70011071 = "A special companion of Gretel. It resembles a cat with many legs... It's cute, yet somehow disturbing.",
  str_monster_ability_70011071 = "Kittypus unleashes its tentacles, dealing massive damage to Aurorians. Remember: Kittypus' tentaclaws transfer all incoming damage to their host!",
  str_monster_name_70011081 = "Forsaken: Dark Goldor",
  str_monster_name_70011081_en = "Forsaken: Dark Goldor",
  str_monster_desc_70011081 = "Armored Eclipsites from White Night, Black Underbelly.",
  str_monster_ability_70011081 = "Immobile but can attack and knock back targets in a large area.",
  str_monster_name_70011091 = "Forsaken: Denuo Goddess",
  str_monster_name_70011091_en = "Forsaken: Denuo Goddess",
  str_monster_desc_70011091 = "An extremely rare butterfly. It's reclusive by nature, with highly acute senses. The combat power should not be underestimated.",
  str_monster_ability_70011091 = "They catalyze plant growth through pollination, protecting themselves while dealing massive damage to foes.",
  str_monster_ability_70011083 = "Posing an extremely low level of danger, it flees immediately in fear after Aurorians cast their Active Skills.",
  str_monster_name_2909201 = "Stinger: Coalescence",
  str_monster_name_2909202 = "Stinger's Tail",
  str_monster_name_2909201_en = "Stinger: Coalescence",
  str_monster_desc_2909201 = "A dangerous weapon created by combining the deadly characteristics of many mechanical creations, including technology from Astra. Ordinary power sources are unable to keep this giant creature going.",
  str_monster_ability_2909201 = "Each Clockwork Beast that forms a part of its body has its own unique attack. The tail can gather Energy to deal guaranteed damage to its targets, but it is also relatively fragile.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290920101 = "Unbreakable Armor",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290920101 = "Gains a Shield equal to a percentage of Max HP at the beginning of each round. The remaining Shield is converted to HP at the end of the round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290920102 = "Damage Avoidance",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290920102 = "Stinger's tail can only be damaged by Sniper skills and is immune to normal attacks and area damage. When its tail has zero HP remaining, Stinger is paralyzed for 1 round.",
  str_monster_name_2004001 = "Furnace-Forged Crab",
  str_monster_desc_2004001 = "This mechanical tool creation was designed to help craftsmen make ingenious inventions. Later, it was modified so that a variation of this invention could store Flame Force in its belly. It was never intended to be used as a weapon.",
  str_monster_ability_2004001 = "It moves sideways like a crab, swinging its pincers, and can spit out fire.",
  str_monster_name_70011141 = "Forsaken: Rebecca Venomswamp",
  str_monster_name_70011141_en = "Forsaken: Rebecca Venomswamp",
  str_monster_name_70011151 = "Forsaken: Mudbundle",
  str_monster_name_70011151_en = "Forsaken: Mudbundle",
  str_monster_ability_2003411 = "Creates quagmires on the tiles moved over. Possessing extremely high DEF, it will regenerate and enhance itself after it is devoured.",
  str_monster_name_2906201 = "Vilanor: Cursed Trap",
  str_monster_name_2906201_en = "Vilanor: Cursed Trap",
  str_monster_desc_2906201 = "A deftly crafted sword born from the ingenuity of the Ye Kingdom of Longzhou. It was originally intended as a self-defense weapon for those who did not know how to defend themselves with a sword, but has now become a cursed evil sword after falling into the hands of villains.",
  str_monster_ability_2906201 = "After becoming Vilanor, its abilities are greatly enhanced, gaining the power to move freely through the field and generate swords out of evil energy.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290620101 = "Deep Grudge",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290620101 = "Before moving, Vilanor summons strands of Vile Sword Energy at random locations based on the amount of damage it has taken in this round. The more damage taken in this round, the more strands of Vile Sword Energy summoned.",
  str_monster_name_2004301 = "Vile Sword Energy",
  str_monster_desc_2004301 = "This sword energy released by Vilanor assumes a sword-like form after reaching a certain density.",
  str_monster_ability_2004301 = "The sword energy summoned by Vilanor can't attack or move, but will occupy the tile it is on, making it untraversable.",
  str_monster_desc_1602191 = "Contender - Istvan",
  str_monster_ability_1602191 = "After moving, casts a Normal Attack or Chain Combo, dealing lots of damage to Eclipsites.",
  str_monster_ability_1602192 = "After moving, casts a Normal Attack or Chain Combo, dealing lots of damage to Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_1600391 = "Istvan",
  str_monster_name_1600391_en = "ISTVAN",
  str_monster_name_70011191 = "Forsaken: Fujikumo Nobutora - Devour",
  str_monster_name_70011191_en = "Forsaken: Fujikumo Nobutora - Devour",
  str_monster_ability_70011191 = "Conjure up a large number of ghosts and unleash different powerful skills based on the distance between Aurorians and the enemy in each round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200440101 = "Mechanical Contamination",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200440101 = "Reflects damage after taking damage from Aurorians' Normal Attacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_200460101 = "Mechanical Repair",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_200460101 = "Recovers a certain percentage of lost HP at the start of each round.",
  str_monster_name_2004401 = "Soldier Voidcross",
  str_monster_desc_2004401 = "A war weapon created through the fusion of Eclipsites and Aurorians. The characteristics of Aurorians have been retained as much as possible, and the mechanization is not too obvious, but it is still very dangerous.",
  str_monster_ability_2004401 = "A mechanical life form that attacks by hacking and slashing.",
  str_monster_name_2004501 = "Soldier Ululat",
  str_monster_desc_2004501 = "A war weapon created through the fusion of Eclipsites and Aurorians. It is protected by a thick layer of mechanical armor, and its strength has been enhanced to the greatest extent possible.",
  str_monster_ability_2004501 = "This modified mechanical life form's power and defense have been improved greatly, and it excels at attacking with explosions and other similar methods.",
  str_monster_name_2004601 = "Super-Soldier Meaugm",
  str_monster_name_2004601_en = "Super-Soldier Meaugm",
  str_monster_desc_2004601 = "A super weapon created through the fusion of Eclipsites and Aurorians. It no longer has Aurorian characteristics and is now a fully mechanical existence.",
  str_monster_ability_2004601 = "This modified mechanical life form can use its thick armor as a weapon, making it very tough to handle.",
  str_monster_name_2906401 = "Super-Soldier Blaugm",
  str_monster_name_2906401_en = "Super-Soldier Blaugm",
  str_monster_desc_2906401 = "This super soldier is an Eclipsite that has been equipped with mechanical devices all over its body to make it tougher, more ferocious, and more intimidating.",
  str_monster_ability_2906401 = "An intimidating super soldier that excels at crushing nearby enemies with its attacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290640101 = "Mechanical Absorption",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290640101 = "Gains 1 stack of Mechanical Armor when taking a Normal Attack. Each stack reduces Normal Attack taken by 1%. The number of stacks of this buff is halved at the start of the round.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290640102 = "Mechanical Defense",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290640102 = "Reduces the damage received from frontal attacks.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_290640103 = "Mechanical Frenzy",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_290640103 = "Increases damage as its own HP decreases.",
  str_monster_name_2906301 = "Ulysses Bio",
  str_monster_name_2906301_en = "Ulysses Bio",
  str_monster_desc_2906301 = "Ulysses modified his body extensively to realize his extreme ideals. He is no longer an Aurorian now.",
  str_monster_ability_2906301 = "Ulysses uses different attack strategies based on the abilities of the Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_8024441 = "When a Murkmite hits a target, reduces the target's force points by 2.",
  str_monster_name_8024161 = "Evil Will: Shadow",
  str_monster_name_8024442 = "Evil Will: Murkmite",
  str_monster_name_80243111 = "Evil Will: Augean",
  str_monster_name_80243111_en = "Evil Will: Augean",
  str_monster_name_7001121 = "Forsaken: Merman King",
  str_monster_ability_7001121 = "Attacks inflict knockback. Can summon Salvo Guns at specific locations on the battlefield.",
  str_monster_name_7001121_en = "Forsaken: Merman King",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_7001121 = "Salvo Gun Deployment",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_7001121 = "At the start of the player's round, if less than 3 Salvo Guns are on the battlefield, summons 4 Salvo Guns.",
  str_monster_name_2004701 = "Fiendling: Rat",
  str_monster_desc_2004701 = "Small-sized omnivorous fiendlings with insufficient cultivation, keeping a wild nature. They always sneak into Aurorian dwellings to steal food. Some aggressive ones may even cause harm.",
  str_monster_ability_2004701 = "Nimble and quick, it swiftly moves behind the target after an attack.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2004701 = "Gnaw of the Rodent",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2004701 = "Targets the Aurorian with the lowest DEF in the team when attacking, dealing damage.",
  str_monster_ability_5412041 = "An Eclipsite with summoning abilities. Unable to move on its own, it fights by summoning Gloom Ghouls that possess ranged attack abilities. Gloom Ghouls sacrifice their own HP to heal Croweye upon entering the battle and transfer damage to Croweye when receiving damage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_5412042 = "Sacrificial Symbiosis",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_5412042 = "It sacrifices its own HP to heal Croweye upon entering the battle and transfers damage to Croweye when receiving damage.",
  str_monster_name_541100216 = "Chen'ni",
  str_monster_desc_541100216 = "The kid that suddenly popped up out of nowhere seemed to be a peculiar fiendling with an appearance like us?",
  str_monster_ability_541100216 = "Her abilities are astounding!",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_541301215 = "At the start of the player's round, if less than 2 Salvo Guns are on the battlefield, summons 4 Salvo Guns.",
  str_monster_name_2909301 = "Fiendling: Nian",
  str_monster_name_2909301_en = "Fiendling: Nian",
  str_monster_desc_2909301 = "Legend has it that on the eve of Spring Festival, a fierce beast-like fiendling descends upon Longzhou, causing chaos. Those who successfully expel it are blessed with a whole year of peace and good fortune.",
  str_monster_ability_2909301 = "Nian will destroy everything in sight as it approaches the village. Only Aurorians possessing powerful Active Skills are able to stop it.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2909301 = "Formidable Ancient Beast",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2909301 = "Nian's formidable presence is terrifying! Tiles within 1 surrounding cluster cannot be selected as Aurorian's landing points.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2909302 = "Burst through the Gate",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2909302 = "The Nian beast will destroy the gate and, upon entering, lay waste to everything, causing the battle to fail.",
  str_monster_name_70011251 = "Forsaken: Cerritus",
  str_monster_name_70011251_en = "Forsaken: Cerritus",
  str_monster_desc_70011251 = "The new Eclipsite encountered during the exploration seems to be a variant of a powerful Eclipsite, except it is more deranged and far more destructive.",
  str_monster_ability_70011251 = "Forsaken: Cerritus charges at Aurorians, summoning pebbles and generating weakened tiles continuously on the field. It can also enhance its own ACT during combat.",
  str_monster_name_70011261 = "Forsaken: Chandra",
  str_monster_name_70011261_en = "Forsaken: Chandra",
  str_monster_desc_70011261 = "An optimistic and cheerful Illumina researcher, she has a special ability to absorb negative emotions from others and heal their mental trauma.",
  str_monster_ability_70011261 = "Forsaken: Chandra can launch attacks on Aurorians from a distance and continuously increase the number of times her skill deals damage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_70011261 = "Forsaken: Gather Negative Emotions",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_70011261 = "With each cast of Forsaken: Negative Emotion Project, the skill launches 1 more attack the next time, dealing increased total damage.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_80051412 = "Warfront Strategy",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_80051412 = "The Courier can store battle energy to motivate monsters. When there are more than 30 points of battle energy, it provides a permanent 10% ATK boost to all monsters on the field at the end of each round. However, the Courier will trigger an energy explosion upon death, dealing massive damage to all monsters on the field.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_80051413 = "Energy Access",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_80051413 = "The Courier automatically restores 10 stacks of battle energy at the start of each round. When the Aurorian releases an Active Skill on the field, it reduces the Courier's battle energy stacks by 4. Also, the Courier loses 1 stack of battle energy when hit by the Aurorian's normal attack.",
  str_monster_name_2909401 = "Ira",
  str_monster_name_2909401_en = "Ira",
  str_monster_desc_2909401 = "An enigmatic and formidable Wraith, traversing the lands for training. His breath exudes terror, foretelling doom for those who incur his wrath.",
  str_monster_ability_2909401 = [[
Able to summon Shadowfire with Darkflow in battle.
Note: Ira's Darkflow Meteorite, composed of raging flames, can instantly kill Aurorians within its range.]],
  str_monster_name_2004801 = "Shadowfire",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2004801 = "Shadowfire Ashes",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2004801 = "Upon elimination, Shadowfire leaves behind Dark Tiles at its location.",
  str_monster_ability_5435071 = "Attacks inflict knockback. Can summon salvo guns at nearby tiles for self-protection.",
  str_monster_ability_5435112 = "Take cover in a secure spot, sacrificing a portion of HP each round to restore HP for Philex.",
  str_monster_name_70011271 = "Forsaken: Caracalune",
  str_monster_name_70011271_en = "Forsaken: Caracalune",
  str_monster_name_70011281 = "Forsaken: Maude Solus",
  str_monster_name_70011281_en = "Forsaken: Maude Solus",
  str_monster_ability_70011271 = "Excels at using large area attacks. Locks up the elements of the tiles around it after it moves.",
  str_monster_name_70011321 = "Forsaken: Spider Queen",
  str_monster_name_70011321_en = "Forsaken: Arachnid Queen",
  str_monster_ability_70011321 = "Possessing strong reproductive abilities, it weaves spider webs into a hunting environment and summons a large number of spider offspring to join the battle every 3 rounds.",
  str_monster_name_70110011 = "Forsaken: Grieving Eve",
  str_monster_name_70110011_en = "Forsaken:Grieving Eve",
  str_monster_desc_70110011 = "The pain of isolation and the fear of being severed, those unbearable memories of the past, have shaped the person known as Eve today.",
  str_monster_ability_70110011 = "Each round, summon Dawn Flowers at a set location on the battlefield, increasing DEF according to the number of Dawn Flowers.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_70110011 = "Grief: Metamorphose",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_70110011 = "Every round, summon Dawn Flowers at a set location to increase DEF; each Dawn Flower grants an extra DEF boost.",
  str_monster_name_70110012 = "Dawn Flower",
  str_monster_desc_70110012 = "These simple white flowers, small and ordinary, are among the most precious comforts in her heart.",
  str_monster_ability_70110012 = "Grants an additional DEF bonus for Grieving Eve.",
  str_monster_name_7001134 = "Forsaken: Bennuguardian",
  str_monster_name_7001134_en = "Forsaken:Bennuguardian",
  str_monster_ability_7001134 = "Possesses great power. Accumulates Fury when attacked. When Fury reaches a certain level, enters an Enraged state, reducing damage taken and casting additional powerful skills.",
  str_monster_name_2004901 = "Haze",
  str_monster_desc_2004901 = "Formed from the rapid accumulation of Darkflow around dead Eclipsites. Be careful! The anger and resentment of Eclipsites live on inside it.",
  str_monster_ability_2004901 = "All damage it takes is reduced to 1. It can't attack but will keep moving towards Aurorians.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2004901 = "Entangling Haze",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2004901 = "All damage it takes is reduced to 1. It can't attack but will keep moving towards Aurorians and disappears if it is subjected to displacement effects. Disappears normally after 2 rounds.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2004902 = "All damage it takes is reduced to 1. It can't attack but will keep moving towards Aurorians and disappears if it is subjected to displacement effects. Disappears normally after 3 rounds.",
  str_monster_name_2909501 = "Carrot: Blight",
  str_monster_name_2909501_en = "Carrot: Blight",
  str_monster_desc_2909501 = "After absorbing too much resentment in a dark place and rotting, this carrot has expanded into a bizarre creature that seeks revenge after gaining the power of Darkflow.",
  str_monster_ability_2909501 = "Throws carrots, dealing multiple instances of damage. When rotating at high speed, it deals multiple instances of damage to enemies in a large area and knocks them back.",
  str_monster_ability_2909502 = [[
Throws carrots, dealing multiple instances of damage. When rotating at high speed, it deals multiple instances of damage to enemies in a large area and knocks them back.
In emergencies, it can shrink and burrow into the ground and continue fighting from there.]],
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2909502 = "Blight: Burrow",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2909502 = "If it is invincible when it takes action, it becomes smaller, burrows under the ground, and recovers its full HP.",
  str_monster_ability_5455121 = "Can use cross-shaped or full-screen attacks, and summon thunderbolts.",
  str_monster_ability_4910302 = "Possesses high ATK, and can deal heavy damage in a radial shape to the maximum range.",
  str_monster_ability_5455091 = "Kittypus flails its tentacles to deal massive damage to Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_2909701 = "Insatiable Magmite",
  str_monster_name_2909701_en = "Insatiable Magmite",
  str_monster_desc_2909701 = "An aberrant type of Eclipsite that uses both lava and Darkflow to deal damage.",
  str_monster_ability_2909701 = "Can deal damage in a large area, as well as summon a molten shield to protect itself.",
  str_monster_passiveskill_name_2909701 = "Lava Reflect",
  str_monster_passiveskill_desc_2909701 = "While protected by its molten shield, reflects all incoming normal attacks from Aurorians.",
  str_monster_name_80063701 = "Town Hoodlum",
  str_monster_desc_80063701 = "Hoodlums who have mastered the use of the crossbow and know how to attack precisely, stealthily, and most importantly... safely.",
  str_monster_ability_80063701 = "Can attack targets in a cross shape to the maximum extent of its range.",
  str_monster_name_80063801 = "Town Elite Hoodlum",
